    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3544100/extras/10b4df46de94fcbe6eb40bae43cbad60.avif?t=1755229724\" data-has-big width=1560 height=905 /></span>Regarding: Returning to the University Era</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >University is one of the most beautiful journeys in life. We have many beautiful memories and regrets in university.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Return to College &quot;is a text-based adventure game set against the backdrop of college campus life, giving you a chance to revisit or make up for your regrets.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >On the day you return to college after taking a leave of absence, which of the various goddesses you meet here will you choose to be your partner.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Here, there are various goddesses with different styles</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3544100/extras/24277bda10309b5cfcfe1a90bbfbf607.avif?t=1755229724\" width=1183 height=827 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3544100/extras/026a18ddf2fc1e8b84270c1702523c35.avif?t=1755229724\" width=1183 height=827 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3544100/extras/3873e0072ac7811ecaaf50cc5c49add3.avif?t=1755229724\" data-has-big width=1600 height=900 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3544100/extras/bafea8744ceb69506b4b18d13c0efdfc.avif?t=1755229724\" data-has-big width=1600 height=914 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3544100/extras/83c10d7a3a2a66236c2b3619ebd02b24.avif?t=1755229724\" data-has-big width=1600 height=914 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3544100/extras/10b4df46de94fcbe6eb40bae43cbad60.avif?t=1755229724\" data-has-big width=1560 height=905 /></span>Regarding: Returning to the University Era</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >University is one of the most beautiful journeys in life. We have many beautiful memories and regrets in university.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Return to College &quot;is a text-based adventure game set against the backdrop of college campus life, giving you a chance to revisit or make up for your regrets.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >On the day you return to college after taking a leave of absence, which of the various goddesses you meet here will you choose to be your partner.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Here, there are various goddesses with different styles</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3544100/extras/24277bda10309b5cfcfe1a90bbfbf607.avif?t=1755229724\" width=1183 height=827 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3544100/extras/026a18ddf2fc1e8b84270c1702523c35.avif?t=1755229724\" width=1183 height=827 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3544100/extras/3873e0072ac7811ecaaf50cc5c49add3.avif?t=1755229724\" data-has-big width=1600 height=900 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3544100/extras/bafea8744ceb69506b4b18d13c0efdfc.avif?t=1755229724\" data-has-big width=1600 height=914 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3544100/extras/83c10d7a3a2a66236c2b3619ebd02b24.avif?t=1755229724\" data-has-big width=1600 height=914 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
